     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Skincare clinic interior design, 54 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN (Bratislava, Slovakia)</strong> developed an interior design project for ABC Cosmetology, a 54 m² skincare clinic. The project was completed under the “Express” design package, with a focus on functional space planning, client comfort, and convenience for the specialists."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The layout includes a reception and waiting area, treatment rooms, and a restroom; the rooms are arranged around the flow of treatments and the movement of clients and staff."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project included photorealistic 3D visualizations and technical documentation for implementation."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong> designs skincare clinics, aesthetic medicine clinics, and beauty salons in Bratislava and Vienna, taking into account the specifics of the business and the size of the premises."
      }
     ]
    },
